{"summary":"A turn-based game inspired by old-school strategies","description":"Braveland is a turn-based game inspired by old-school strategies with hexagonal battlefield. You will start as a humble warrior's son whose village was cruelly raided and will end as talented commander of your army. \nThe story will take place in a hand-drawn world and cover many interesting places and characters. Various warriors will join your army - archers, scouts, healers, footmen, arbalesters and more.\n\n- Turn-based battles in old-school style.\n- Command your troops and defeat enemies in hand to hand battles.\n- 26 various warriors and creatures from archers to golems.\n- Three story chapters each in unique corner of the world.\n- Evolve your hero, find awesome artifacts and learn battle magic.\n- Intense boss fights at the end of each story chapter.\n- Hours of gameplay with 50 battles.\n- High definition awesome illustrated cartoon art.","esrbNotes":"Alcohol Reference, Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uYIrJtotfHg?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNYYiSUKtxyg6s7q1Ha1_oiqQu7d9WOKWsGEBoMDQmiVzSwK_XANV8N54JqGXtub1hYEfbPn9cHz0ojXNaJw-zc","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F4QQyNkpN2SCwZat_3TjM5qIqcSVV7YHLoDJH0eZh5B3BoUSQbg9lTPWG8gca4GLJkqUN_1NDDS7V4lrCO5G","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4qYI_5o1DOIw5bDVTt0qEiuszw1KsSHDMT3pK8jljY0e2z1oE6Hosd3fNKDoENsUv-nJn_mj0N33z8h6kSb7gg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Bir6JBzU3V3fho9rWxQMP9Eyl35u6hqUNUmrQvq4lJsZerxbbkOTe1wuRmzIBw6XUARIeGXmAAO94Tv0XLbdig","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2n-_Ffg-SeCVB0vWebDo1rydoSDDmz0qyArFp8U4UEge8foJqUOIeJE2me7HwvXVpDtsn9gczvaDVLdpD_rltw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WrFv_VaEkyCaHv0Jk_sD6ThNnr4oQnf59LTVEi1WSEUhxlalUmuev9XIh428kWAMiBBLiGSPNtgnmpIO0WlE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F4QQyNkpN2SCwZat_3TjM5qIqcSVV7YHLoDJH0eZh5B3BoUSQbg9l